        <mxCell id="wzzd5CX_dV33YkVSsU24-42" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5665" y="2128" width="441.42" height="445" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wzzd5CX_dV33YkVSsU24-45" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;Aging clock&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Aging model performance:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- scores need to be benchmarked against Wenchau&#39;s model&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;SLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- all cell types show age acceleration. This pattern is for young&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Covid:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- only MONO and NK show sig age acceleration&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- considering that there was no overlap in aging and disease TFs, this could indicate the multivariate model&#39;s advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Drug perturbation:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- the model is only able to show the Rux. effect on MONO. We should see some effects on other cell types (check the unsig results)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-7906" y="3654" width="928" height="534" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bhtp2lKR-vHPIfjG2KL_-2" value="" style="shape=partialRectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;bottom=1;right=1;left=1;top=0;fillColor=none;routingCenterX=-0.5;rotation=-180;strokeWidth=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-7034" y="5875" width="3788" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bhtp2lKR-vHPIfjG2KL_-4" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;Aging shift in drug therapy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- strong response from MONO;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- strong response for LPS and Rux.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CD8T&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- high (oppositie) overlap for both LPS and Rux. considering that LPS has in general more sig TFs, higher overlap is expected. also, LPS induced more decreased TFs, high countering the aging TFs with increased in aging is expected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Rux. shows full overlap with TFs increase and decrease in aging&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
